    "image_with_text_BeNLWF": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Media with text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "Antimicrobial Healthcare Upholstery",
        "title": "MEDIFLEX",
        "title_size": 42,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>Engineered for the most demanding clinical environments, MEDIFLEX combines antifungal, antibacterial, and antiviral surface protection with a soft touch and refined aesthetics. Compatible with alcohol- and bleach-based disinfection protocols, biocompatible to ISO 10993-5 and ISO 10993-10, and backed by a <strong>10-year performance warranty</strong>. Ideal for hospitals, care homes, and medical furniture manufacturers.</p><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0711/9801/5791/files/Medical__Mediflex.pdf?v=1774030658\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mediflex Catalogue\"><strong>Download Catalogue</strong></a></p>",
        "button_label": "ORDER free SAMPLES",
        "button_link": "shopify://products/mediflex-collection",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_width": 50,
        "button_style": "auto",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/MR_banner_MEDIFLEX.png",
        "image_width": 80,
        "image_position": "right",
        "media_size": "cover",
        "color_scheme": "standard",
        "color_bg": "",
        "color_text": ""
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_Yeg6Ui": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Media with text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "Antistatic doesn't have to be black",
        "title": "ELECTRA",
        "title_size": 42,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>ELECTRA is a permanently antistatic coated fabric developed for ICUs, imaging rooms, and operating theatres. Its antistatic performance is stable and humidity-independent, it resists microbial growth, and — unlike conventional antistatic fabrics — it's available in a sophisticated palette, from timeless greys to five additional deep tones. Heat-weldable and bi-elastic for ease of manufacturing. </p><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0711/9801/5791/files/MR_web_cat_ELECTRA_JUL2025_Ipad_v2.pdf?v=1774030697\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Electra Catalogue\"><strong>Download Catalogue</strong></a></p>",
        "button_label": "order free samples",
        "button_link": "shopify://products/electra-collection",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_width": 50,
        "button_style": "auto",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/MR_banner_ELECTRA.png",
        "image_width": 80,
        "image_position": "left",
        "media_size": "cover",
        "color_scheme": "standard",
        "color_bg": "",
        "color_text": ""
      }
    },
    "text_columns_with_images_nXmzc8": {
      "type": "text-columns-with-images",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_94kmkN": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/PEELSalt_65895.jpg",
            "image_width": 700,
            "title": "PEEL — 65% Bio-Based Upholstery",
            "text": "<p>Made with chestnut by-products, vegetable oils, and biobased cotton, PEEL delivers a certified 65% biobased content without compromising on performance. Abrasion resistance up to 400,000 Martindale cycles, high fire resistance, and 8 contemporary stock colours — proof that circular design and industrial durability can coexist. </p><p><a href=\"/products/peel-collection\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"PEEL COLLECTION\">Order free samples</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/peel-collection"
          }
        },
        "text_block_qHc8Dr": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/PROSOFT-100782.jpg",
            "image_width": 700,
            "title": "PROSOFT — High-Traffic Seating for Stadiums & Auditoriums",
            "text": "<p>Built for venues where durability is non-negotiable. PROSOFT meets BS 5852 Crib 7 and NF P 92-507 M1 fire standards, offers outstanding abrasion resistance, and features an easy-clean surface for fast turnaround between events. Phthalate-free and fully weldable.</p><p><a href=\"/products/prosoft-collection\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"PROSOFT COLLECTION\">Order free samples</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/prosoft-collection"
          }
        },
        "text_block_VWC4Mt": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/MARINA_OCEAN.jpg",
            "image_width": 700,
            "title": "OCEAN — Performance Fabric for Outdoor Upholstery",
            "text": "<p>Engineered for extreme outdoor conditions, OCEAN exceeds 400,000 Martindale cycles, resists mould, UV degradation, stains, and fluids — and stays looking sharp over years of intensive use. Phthalate-free and easy to maintain. </p><p><a href=\"/products/ocean-collection\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"OCEAN COLLECTION\">Order free samples</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/ocean-collection"
          }
        }
      },
